              <lg xml:id="m-2abbd6d5-4603-4eaa-8b85-62f0009826b3">
                <l xml:id="m-aeec6136-debe-4467-81bc-4b89aa8d1f26" facs="#m-e08d4ab5-fec5-4b33-b935-578080f27ee1" label="ambiguous">498</l><l xml:id="m-8924609f-b8ac-48e7-b7c0-bc5150a76bd3" facs="#m-4629cdc1-06c3-419d-8402-ce2ca6d13270" label="text-like">Septuagesima Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-299a2afa-999d-424d-9f5d-3a6c5e90be9e" facs="#m-d9aa13d2-92fa-4732-867b-7d171ba64c80" label="ambiguous">Saturday before Septuagesima.</l><l xml:id="m-8bc80c6e-6824-4444-9709-78485a50de8f" facs="#m-54596228-05b1-40cc-949c-125359b20a4d" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-0e651e56-92e5-406a-a0d9-d2e86cf1eaf8" facs="#m-cecbb6a1-f8c0-4ae1-81e0-3f4a017fa938" label="text-like">Psalms and Antiphons of the Saturday, p. 307.</l><l xml:id="m-bb84fed4-469f-46c5-b88e-2bbf64aec141" facs="#m-e7a806b5-0eb8-4760-8a57-c41364dcd68e" label="lyrics-like">Chapter. Fratres: Nescítis. p. 502. Hymn. Jam sol recédit. p. 312.</l><l xml:id="m-870b4286-02bd-4c7c-8007-df722b1dd872" facs="#m-4e55787c-eaa2-4a2f-a54d-0d0ff6373a00" label="lyrics-like">V. Vespertína orátio ascéndat ad te Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-9e47bfbb-aa7a-44ad-8122-45c249b9e004" facs="#m-c96cf971-4728-4bb2-8d10-30eada2267a4" label="lyrics-like">F. Et descéndat super nos misericórdia túa.</l><l xml:id="m-c1bdadc0-5001-4918-8480-287cf7838b57" facs="#m-3989995a-afa7-48c5-8aa3-0cd58d409394" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-80ac6ae6-c29b-44c3-bf69-eb3a14c5b83b" facs="#m-dde6fee1-04a1-415e-92c3-30b7fead6f15" label="ambiguous">Ant. S. G</l><l xml:id="m-5ca2adfb-93a1-417d-bf14-b2cd25b28405" facs="#m-2f5bece8-9e18-4d60-a3d9-9c29eebd504b" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-bb7b61a9-d65e-4037-8e5b-f4bef970208f" facs="#m-c11e4f32-d85c-406e-a015-2a101b46d158" label="lyrics-like">Ixit Dóminus “ad A-dam: De lígno quod est</l><l xml:id="m-09e2b939-8ba7-473d-b3e5-7c86c71d4cda" facs="#m-f36fe319-8cc7-45f0-9dbc-8cf694175443" label="lyrics-like">in médi-  pa-radí-si, ne cómedas: in qua hó-ra comé¬</l><l xml:id="m-2b8bf4ec-e687-4ad3-a1f7-03649df01edb" facs="#m-92b39a27-d14d-4b46-b47d-3a4000f0e2bf" label="lyrics-like">de-ris, mór- te mo-ri- é-ris. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-8741822b-0f75-4c52-be35-07d9e13dea48" facs="#m-d05c0c11-846b-40e8-a799-3951f55103d6" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. p. 212. Prayer. Preces pópuli. p. 498.</l><l xml:id="m-a215892a-aef6-4dbb-9f0c-7c6f20a5dcf6" facs="#m-ac9060fc-e401-4ebf-b75e-11e3bb50e8a4" label="lyrics-like">At the V. Benedicámus Dómino. a double Allelúia. is added as on Easter</l><l xml:id="m-f2db12bf-db33-4723-9e26-2830fe46461b" facs="#m-e84e7b64-8afb-41bb-a06a-7acb6ddea08d" label="text-like">Sunday, p. 783; then Alleluia. is not said from this day until the Mass of the</l><l xml:id="m-8d4184c5-7e51-4313-9fd6-c7af838a39fd" facs="#m-21d90088-e4e7-4535-8e49-b44a806363be" label="ambiguous">Easter Vigil.</l><l xml:id="m-17e1c4a1-1443-4f2a-b143-8248a2a9a1b6" facs="#m-af215540-82e8-4c13-8351-0474631925f1" label="text-like">Septuagesima Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-b846a07f-0317-4ffe-affe-676ab1e9d0aa" facs="#m-0048e362-2e8a-4cd1-87ed-3fa8bd60ace2" label="text-like">AT PRIME.</l><l xml:id="m-f9ffe879-47cb-4bb6-9a9b-7770d1d4341b" facs="#m-3fb1f035-729f-40ba-818c-37e36b976f2c" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-41de2ae7-24f9-4ac4-938c-fbd53739264d" facs="#m-d26a3f1a-d7be-4e4a-b2e7-414e97c8e4e3" label="ambiguous">i.f</l><l xml:id="m-5bef9ef1-c8d6-4f67-9ad6-a5e3dd328785" facs="#m-a905bb6c-8177-4b0e-8355-d98ae0169cbb" label="lyrics-like">Onventi-óne autem“ fá¬ cta cum ope-rá-ri-is</l><l xml:id="m-2fb09443-dc72-44d3-94c9-505d20453359" facs="#m-2f2b68b5-210d-4918-8430-f58774a8509c" label="lyrics-like">ex dená-ri-o di-úr-no, mí-sit é- os in víne-am sú-am.</l><l xml:id="m-e620f569-e6d0-41c2-a3d1-4e1f61e52046" facs="#m-70ec5da1-735a-4ee4-8d7a-02591a09f494" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-886f7f30-7668-409e-8391-9e273c4bc5b1" facs="#m-83871ea0-9ab3-4dd4-a8ed-5733f9d4963d" label="lyrics-like">Short Lesson. Dóminus autem dirigat. p. 233.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
